Package: libmmt-dpi1
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: deep packet inspection library (runtime)
 MMT-DPI extracts data attributes from network packets, server logs and
 other structured events, and classifies the application protocol of each
 flow, so that the results can be analysed or monitored in real time.
 .
 The core engine loads its protocol dissectors as plugins: TCP/IP, mobile
 core (S1AP, NGAP, GTPv2, NAS, Diameter), DICOM and business applications.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries and the protocol plugins.

Package: libmmt-dpi-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libmmt-dpi1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: deep packet inspection library (development files)
 MMT-DPI extracts data attributes from network packets, server logs and
 other structured events, and classifies the application protocol of each
 flow, so that the results can be analysed or monitored in real time.
 .
 This package contains the C headers, the unversioned library symlinks, the
 pkg-config file (mmt-dpi.pc) and the example programs.
